WEBVTT

00:01:30.640 --> 00:01:32.730
Sorry! Something sudden
came up, so I'm logging off!

00:01:36.140 --> 00:01:40.720
The other day, I gave Kanbe-san
reason to suspect something was up.

00:01:41.400 --> 00:01:45.770
I suddenly logged off without
any explanation as to why.

00:01:46.370 --> 00:01:50.170
That in itself would normally be enough
to leave me feeling weighed down.

00:01:51.300 --> 00:01:52.670
But more than that...

00:01:53.300 --> 00:01:56.590
I no longer have the courage
to see "Hayashi-san"

00:01:56.590 --> 00:01:59.170
and hear what he has to say
about me and Koiwai-san.

00:02:00.680 --> 00:02:02.010
This is strange.

00:02:02.930 --> 00:02:07.870
Lily was supposed to be carefree.

00:02:08.940 --> 00:02:11.940
Episode 7

00:02:08.940 --> 00:02:11.940
You and I, and Me and You

00:02:15.720 --> 00:02:18.950
I wonder if Lily-san is
going to log in today.

00:02:27.270 --> 00:02:30.710
I always log in during the day on Sundays.

00:02:30.710 --> 00:02:32.560
She said that made her happy.

00:02:43.430 --> 00:02:45.970
I remember when I first ran into her,

00:02:46.380 --> 00:02:49.980
then hearing a similar story
about someone else.

00:02:49.980 --> 00:02:53.900
All I thought was, "I guess this stuff
does happen," and basically ignored it.

00:02:55.850 --> 00:03:00.340
Looking back on it, it was
me and Morioka-san all along.

00:03:01.990 --> 00:03:06.870
I had a lot of fun doting
on Hayashi-san as Lily.

00:03:07.330 --> 00:03:10.370
Is it really okay for me to take all this?

00:03:10.690 --> 00:03:12.800
I hadn't played with a newbie in a long time.

00:03:12.800 --> 00:03:16.380
He was so cute and modest,
and was always so earnest when he spoke.

00:03:17.310 --> 00:03:18.880
I wonder which I should wear!

00:03:22.940 --> 00:03:25.070
L-Lily-san!

00:03:27.310 --> 00:03:28.890
I guess it started around then.

00:03:29.550 --> 00:03:31.490
I began to feel that things I got in-game,

00:03:31.490 --> 00:03:33.900
I wanted to return in-game.

00:03:35.020 --> 00:03:37.760
I was so moved back then,

00:03:38.160 --> 00:03:39.900
and I wanted to keep
that experience in-game.

00:03:40.890 --> 00:03:43.160
Hayashi-san seemed to devote himself to me,

00:03:43.550 --> 00:03:48.010
and so I thought I'd do
the same in turn for him.

00:03:50.600 --> 00:03:54.190
Honestly, I know I was getting too involved.

00:03:54.910 --> 00:03:58.850
And if I hadn't found out,
I could have stayed that way forever.

00:04:00.530 --> 00:04:04.850
Yet the more I learned about
Hayashi-san and Morioka-san,

00:04:04.850 --> 00:04:08.180
the more I felt my "maybe"
turn into "it has to be."

00:04:10.150 --> 00:04:11.360
Now what do I do?

00:04:13.300 --> 00:04:14.480
Right now, I just...

00:04:15.720 --> 00:04:17.000
Hayashi-san...

00:04:18.180 --> 00:04:19.410
Morioka-san...

00:04:20.660 --> 00:04:21.690
I miss you.

00:04:27.450 --> 00:04:29.200
Hayashi:  Good evening!
Lilac:  Evenyaa!
Himeralda:  Hey!
Lily-san has logged in.

00:04:33.020 --> 00:04:35.400
Lily-san, good evening!

00:04:36.810 --> 00:04:38.140
Evening!

00:04:38.140 --> 00:04:39.310
Heya!

00:04:41.350 --> 00:04:43.380
Good evening, everyone.

00:04:44.300 --> 00:04:46.510
Lily-san, what do you want to do?

00:04:46.770 --> 00:04:50.110
Today, I thought I'd sort through
what I have in storage.

00:04:50.110 --> 00:04:52.770
I've got a few too many outfits.

00:04:53.530 --> 00:04:54.980
I want to see!

00:04:54.980 --> 00:04:58.400
You've got all sorts of clothes,
so it'll be like a fashion show!

00:04:58.680 --> 00:05:00.280
I'd like to see, too.

00:05:00.280 --> 00:05:01.900
Your collection of avatar styles.

00:05:04.320 --> 00:05:05.000
I...

00:05:06.890 --> 00:05:07.910
I...

00:05:08.730 --> 00:05:11.690
I'd be happy to show you!

00:05:18.990 --> 00:05:21.320
Wh-What do you think?

00:05:22.250 --> 00:05:24.410
She's super cute!

00:05:25.460 --> 00:05:28.430
Aw, you're so lucky!

00:05:28.780 --> 00:05:31.260
Lily-chan has a whole bunch
of avatar outfits I want.

00:05:31.260 --> 00:05:35.310
I want them so much I can't
even stand looking at them!

00:05:35.610 --> 00:05:37.110
I just don't have the money.

00:05:38.440 --> 00:05:41.820
You can't compare yourself to her level.

00:05:42.010 --> 00:05:46.950
She undertook special training, and now
she's addicted to buying premium content.

00:05:47.390 --> 00:05:48.600
Now that I'm looking at it,

00:05:48.600 --> 00:05:52.690
I'm realizing there's all sorts of designs
made just for female characters. You're lucky.

00:05:53.210 --> 00:05:55.040
You can even change your hair.

00:05:55.740 --> 00:05:59.460
Male characters can change
their hair if it's not short, too.

00:06:00.950 --> 00:06:04.330
Look what happens if I put
this ribbon on Hime-san.

00:06:07.220 --> 00:06:09.470
A bit of a letdown for such an elaborate style

00:06:08.000 --> 00:06:08.920
How do I look?

00:06:09.780 --> 00:06:11.970
Huh? It got shorter.

00:06:12.340 --> 00:06:15.980
That's just the length of the style,
so you can't do anything about it.

00:06:16.190 --> 00:06:20.230
But it's so fun that you can change
your hair without paying for it.

00:06:20.860 --> 00:06:23.230
Yeah? That sounds great.

00:06:23.870 --> 00:06:27.650
I should have chosen a different
hairstyle that wasn't short.

00:06:27.650 --> 00:06:28.240
Wait.

00:06:28.750 --> 00:06:29.670
Huh?

00:06:29.670 --> 00:06:30.240
Then...

00:06:30.820 --> 00:06:35.370
Kanbe-san's hair isn't short, so he can
use items to change his style, right?

00:06:32.780 --> 00:06:35.370
Concept drawing

00:06:36.700 --> 00:06:40.740
I actually got him to put one on once.

00:06:40.740 --> 00:06:42.610
That was funny.

00:06:46.330 --> 00:06:47.510
That sounds hilarious.

00:06:48.260 --> 00:06:50.690
But I bet Kanbe-san would be angry.

00:06:51.300 --> 00:06:53.860
Kanbe-san is the kind of person
that goes with the flow,

00:06:53.860 --> 00:06:56.020
so he might just put one on for you, too.

00:06:56.480 --> 00:07:00.140
I wonder if we're out here so she can
talk about what I think she's going to.

00:07:00.940 --> 00:07:02.020
It's like...

00:07:05.180 --> 00:07:08.800
I'm just as nervous as the first time I
was taken out to visit clients at work.

00:07:10.520 --> 00:07:13.060
I keep thinking about what will happen,

00:07:13.060 --> 00:07:15.070
and everything I imagine ends badly.

00:07:16.600 --> 00:07:19.090
I already made up my mind, didn't I?

00:07:21.250 --> 00:07:24.540
I thought you wouldn't log in today.

00:07:24.780 --> 00:07:28.550
S-Sorry, I've just been tied up.

00:07:28.820 --> 00:07:30.850
No, I'm sorry.

00:07:30.850 --> 00:07:32.550
It's good to see you.

00:07:33.060 --> 00:07:37.090
I'm happy. I wanted to thank you for all
the advice you gave me the other day.

00:07:37.090 --> 00:07:39.060
There's lots I want to talk about, too.

00:07:39.540 --> 00:07:40.720
Oh...

00:07:41.430 --> 00:07:42.680
Of course.

00:07:43.390 --> 00:07:46.270
I really did my best in my own way,

00:07:46.270 --> 00:07:48.440
but I ended up messing a lot of stuff up.

00:07:48.820 --> 00:07:51.200
Oh, you did?

00:07:51.970 --> 00:07:53.050
I know.

00:07:54.640 --> 00:07:56.420
My get together was supposed to be yesterday,

00:07:56.420 --> 00:07:58.200
but I messed up and went the wrong day.

00:07:59.770 --> 00:08:02.490
I ended up waiting all alone
for a whole hour.

00:08:04.180 --> 00:08:05.330
I know.

00:08:06.120 --> 00:08:08.710
That sounds like a handful.

00:08:09.180 --> 00:08:11.340
It was. Oh, but...

00:08:11.740 --> 00:08:13.610
This is the surprising part!

00:08:13.610 --> 00:08:16.220
I met that woman with the glasses again.

00:08:16.600 --> 00:08:19.350
It seems she works with the
person I was supposed to see,

00:08:19.350 --> 00:08:21.600
and she came to talk to me
because she realized I was waiting.

00:08:22.180 --> 00:08:24.600
Isn't that amazing for a coincidence?

00:08:25.210 --> 00:08:28.860
There's still a real coincidence
waiting right here.

00:08:29.800 --> 00:08:32.770
Who would have guess the newbie
I happened to take under my wing

00:08:32.770 --> 00:08:34.860
was the woman who wrote
that company manual?

00:08:35.220 --> 00:08:36.870
It's like a story from a manga.

00:08:36.870 --> 00:08:38.210
Isn't it?

00:08:39.550 --> 00:08:40.560
I'm...

00:08:43.060 --> 00:08:44.830
I'm Lily!

00:08:44.830 --> 00:08:47.400
Hayashi-san's partner and a woman!

00:08:48.810 --> 00:08:51.840
I didn't think I had such
a low tolerance for alcohol,

00:08:51.840 --> 00:08:55.210
but it's been a while since I went drinking
with anyone, so it got the better of me.

00:08:56.300 --> 00:09:00.370
I caused her so much trouble,
but she was still so nice to me

00:08:57.600 --> 00:09:00.110
I won't be seeing Morioka-san again.

00:09:00.110 --> 00:09:04.200
And I don't plan on getting involved with
her further, no matter what Koiwai-san says.

00:09:00.370 --> 00:09:02.290
even though I turned her
down once in the past.

00:09:05.670 --> 00:09:08.060
So I'll keep acting just
as I have been until now.

00:09:09.170 --> 00:09:12.650
Really, she's a thoughtful, wonderful person.

00:09:13.990 --> 00:09:15.650
Wait a second.

00:09:16.380 --> 00:09:20.160
The next day, I was a lot
more talkative than usual.

00:09:20.950 --> 00:09:23.930
It was something of a relief.

00:09:23.930 --> 00:09:25.900
But it was all thanks to the day before

00:09:25.900 --> 00:09:28.790
and getting to talk with her
about the person I was meeting.

00:09:29.270 --> 00:09:32.900
I could really give it my all
thanks to all the advice I got.

00:09:33.880 --> 00:09:35.760
That's enough already.

00:09:35.760 --> 00:09:37.930
Start talking about Koiwai-san!

00:09:38.610 --> 00:09:40.930
Oh. Maybe that's why.

00:09:41.900 --> 00:09:44.930
She kind of reminded
me of you for some reason,

00:09:45.130 --> 00:09:46.990
so I sort of saw you in her.

00:09:46.990 --> 00:09:48.940
And because I like you,

00:09:49.120 --> 00:09:51.940
that made me really happy.

00:09:52.930 --> 00:09:54.610
Any more of this and...

00:09:55.860 --> 00:09:59.560
There's no way she could
have figured it out, right?

00:10:00.430 --> 00:10:03.480
Even though I know I shouldn't be
listening to her talk about this as Sakurai,

00:10:06.130 --> 00:10:07.960
I can't help but feel happy.

00:10:09.730 --> 00:10:12.180
I'm sorry, Morioka-san.

00:10:28.730 --> 00:10:30.100
Sakura-chan!

00:10:30.590 --> 00:10:31.770
You free today?

00:10:32.860 --> 00:10:36.110
Oh, right. You've gotta go in this weekend.

00:10:36.110 --> 00:10:42.620
Downloading

00:10:36.670 --> 00:10:38.080
Sucks to be you!

00:10:39.410 --> 00:10:42.620
Huh? Oh, no. It's nothing big.

00:10:42.990 --> 00:10:45.410
See ya later. Do your best!

00:10:47.040 --> 00:10:51.630
I don't normally play games,
so I thought I'd invite him along.

00:10:52.340 --> 00:10:57.050
Well, I've got a better chance of getting
prepared for this by asking Morimori-chan.

00:10:57.050 --> 00:10:58.280
It's an MMO, after all.

00:11:05.170 --> 00:11:07.270
A-A call?

00:11:07.870 --> 00:11:08.620
From who?

00:11:09.890 --> 00:11:11.400
Koiwai Homare

00:11:11.800 --> 00:11:13.770
K-Koiwai-san?

00:11:15.410 --> 00:11:18.230
You want me to teach you about MMOs?

00:11:18.800 --> 00:11:21.370
Huh? Right now? On a notebook?

00:11:21.370 --> 00:11:22.570
What are its specs?

00:11:24.820 --> 00:11:27.910
What? You're already downloading it?

00:11:28.440 --> 00:11:32.480
No, more importantly...
he's gonna play an MMO? Really?

00:11:32.860 --> 00:11:33.960
N-No, wait!

00:11:33.960 --> 00:11:36.480
I know I was genuinely happy there for a sec,

00:11:36.480 --> 00:11:38.920
but I play a guy online!

00:11:39.250 --> 00:11:42.180
How could I do that in front of Koiwai-san?

00:11:42.860 --> 00:11:44.490
I'll protect you.

00:11:45.180 --> 00:11:48.180
Koiwai Temp

00:11:45.790 --> 00:11:47.810
Stick close to me.

00:11:48.180 --> 00:11:51.190
Koiwai Temp

00:11:48.600 --> 00:11:50.930
Putting on the
experienced act

00:11:49.020 --> 00:11:50.930
Leave it to me!

00:11:52.440 --> 00:11:54.600
It's too embarrassing! I can't! I just can't!

00:11:55.320 --> 00:11:57.940
Morimori-chan? Morimori-chan?

00:11:58.570 --> 00:12:02.050
And if we happen to run
into other guild members,

00:12:02.050 --> 00:12:04.450
how am I supposed to explain myself?

00:12:05.290 --> 00:12:07.450
Sorry. Um...

00:12:07.930 --> 00:12:10.040
It finished downloading.

00:12:10.040 --> 00:12:12.090
So I can play the game now, right?

00:12:12.800 --> 00:12:15.520
You've got to install it first.

00:12:15.520 --> 00:12:19.210
Oh. So if I do that, I should be good to go?

00:12:20.240 --> 00:12:22.220
That's right.

00:12:22.510 --> 00:12:25.720
Then I'll contact you
again once I install it.

00:12:26.160 --> 00:12:29.010
R-Right. See you.

00:12:31.980 --> 00:12:33.960
Sorry to make you wait.

00:12:33.960 --> 00:12:37.040
Something came up, so I
have to log off for today.

00:12:37.040 --> 00:12:38.980
Sure. Later.

00:12:44.000 --> 00:12:46.510
We'll only play together for a little while,

00:12:46.510 --> 00:12:48.490
so no need to tell Kanbe-san, right?

00:12:49.170 --> 00:12:52.500
I don't really want to introduce
my online friends to him, anyway.

00:12:56.810 --> 00:13:00.380
Huh? I thought you had to work on weekends.

00:13:02.980 --> 00:13:04.560
Now then...

00:13:04.560 --> 00:13:07.390
I'll have to make a new character.

00:13:08.350 --> 00:13:10.060
A girl, huh?

00:13:10.430 --> 00:13:13.810
I can see the pluses of both
the cool and cute types,

00:13:13.810 --> 00:13:15.640
but this is just to play with Koiwai-san.

00:13:15.640 --> 00:13:17.270
I'll just go with whatever.

00:13:18.620 --> 00:13:21.450
I ended up making her look like Lily-san...

00:13:21.450 --> 00:13:24.650
I guess Lily-san is just my image of cute now.

00:13:25.590 --> 00:13:27.100
Now that I think about it,

00:13:27.100 --> 00:13:30.310
I had a support character
in the last MMO I played.

00:13:30.310 --> 00:13:33.290
I quite liked how she ended up looking.

00:13:37.090 --> 00:13:37.880
All right!

00:13:39.090 --> 00:13:42.280
Nah, I just couldn't take it.

00:13:42.280 --> 00:13:45.130
I'm just gonna be a NEET
and devote myself to MMOs.

00:13:47.000 --> 00:13:50.690
Koiwai-san said he finished the tutorial,

00:13:50.690 --> 00:13:53.310
so he should be around here by now.

00:13:53.910 --> 00:13:55.400
Oh, my god, Kanbe!

00:13:55.400 --> 00:13:56.090
Huh?

00:13:56.500 --> 00:13:59.570
This character's something else!
In the starting town!

00:13:59.570 --> 00:14:00.520
Huh?

00:14:03.430 --> 00:14:05.730
I just finished getting through
all kinds of explanation text.

00:14:05.730 --> 00:14:07.820
Now I'm in the plaza of some town.

00:14:08.250 --> 00:14:10.780
Oh, I called my character Harumi.

00:14:10.780 --> 00:14:12.320
She's a super tall beauty!

00:14:12.320 --> 00:14:13.390
A girl?

00:14:17.580 --> 00:14:20.080
LV 1 Harumi

00:14:18.500 --> 00:14:20.080
Is that him?

00:14:20.750 --> 00:14:21.960
Um...

00:14:22.860 --> 00:14:26.970
Um, Harumi-san? I-It's me, Molly.

00:14:34.320 --> 00:14:36.900
Hey there, Molly-chan!

00:14:38.520 --> 00:14:40.480
I don't even have words!

00:14:40.940 --> 00:14:43.630
Morimori-chan!

00:14:44.490 --> 00:14:46.170
Um, Harumi-san!

00:14:46.170 --> 00:14:48.870
Let's form a party and talk in party chat!

00:14:48.870 --> 00:14:52.910
If we keep talking like this, all the other
users can see what we're saying.

00:14:52.910 --> 00:14:54.700
Yeah, let's group up!

00:14:55.170 --> 00:14:56.340
Er...

00:14:56.340 --> 00:14:57.740
I don't mind going as a group.

00:14:57.740 --> 00:15:00.460
Huh? What's with the sudden shift in character?

00:15:00.460 --> 00:15:03.940
I was inspired by a character from
another game, and that's something she said.

00:15:03.940 --> 00:15:06.780
She's a cool beauty. A blonde bombshell!

00:15:06.780 --> 00:15:09.160
So this character's based on someone?!

00:15:10.080 --> 00:15:11.690
Look, look! Over there!

00:15:11.690 --> 00:15:13.850
Whoa! That's unique.

00:15:14.510 --> 00:15:16.440
And she's saying everything in all chat.

00:15:16.440 --> 00:15:17.990
She's gotta be a newbie.

00:15:19.810 --> 00:15:22.980
It's Kanbe-san and Nico-san. What now?

00:15:23.550 --> 00:15:26.480
My name's different. I should be safe, right?

00:15:26.960 --> 00:15:29.990
So what's this "party chat"? How do I do it?

00:15:30.650 --> 00:15:32.250
Am I already doing it?

00:15:32.250 --> 00:15:32.990
Am I?

00:15:33.230 --> 00:15:34.240
Nope.

00:15:36.620 --> 00:15:37.920
You switch to party chat

00:15:37.920 --> 00:15:42.250
by pressing the little button on the
right side of the text input column.

00:15:42.500 --> 00:15:43.250
Oh?

00:15:43.860 --> 00:15:46.250
Nico-san started talking to us!

00:15:47.060 --> 00:15:49.000
Thank you very much!

00:15:49.000 --> 00:15:53.660
Oh, Harumi-san, you said that in
party chat, so she couldn't hear you.

00:15:53.660 --> 00:15:54.290
Huh?

00:15:55.330 --> 00:15:57.260
Thank you very much!

00:15:57.680 --> 00:15:59.710
My character's totally out of place!

00:15:59.640 --> 00:16:00.770
Player

00:15:59.710 --> 00:16:00.770
Hilarious!

00:16:01.270 --> 00:16:04.650
But that person beside you
isn't a newbie, is she?

00:16:05.880 --> 00:16:07.150
W-Well, no.

00:16:07.540 --> 00:16:10.650
Sorry for butting in.

00:16:11.030 --> 00:16:12.540
Not at all.

00:16:12.540 --> 00:16:15.660
I'm happy to get a chance to
chat with people I don't know.

00:16:16.120 --> 00:16:18.660
My name's Harumi. Pleased to meet you.

00:16:18.920 --> 00:16:21.790
I don't like what's going on here.

00:16:22.360 --> 00:16:23.530
Nice to meet you.

00:16:23.530 --> 00:16:26.290
So, why'd you go with such a Japanese name?

00:16:26.720 --> 00:16:30.070
It's based on my brother's name
and it just fit, so I went with it.

00:16:30.070 --> 00:16:33.070
"It just fit" isn't a good reason at all!

00:16:34.330 --> 00:16:38.440
I'm sure she was just trying
to help out some new players,

00:16:38.930 --> 00:16:42.560
but if we're going to play together,
I feel a bit bad not saying anything.

00:16:43.350 --> 00:16:45.100
Um, Kanbe-san...

00:16:45.100 --> 00:16:48.320
Oh? That surprised me. What is it?

00:16:50.170 --> 00:16:53.820
Kanbe-san being so polite feels kind of weird.

00:16:54.770 --> 00:16:59.050
But I guess initially,
he did call me "Hayashi-kun."

00:16:59.050 --> 00:17:03.030
Compared to now, he kind of treated
me like a stranger back then.

00:17:04.900 --> 00:17:09.510
It makes me kind of happy thinking
about how close we've gotten.

00:17:10.710 --> 00:17:15.130
Um, well, actually, I'm...

00:17:26.900 --> 00:17:28.610
You've received a message

00:17:33.170 --> 00:17:34.370
Hey there!

00:17:34.370 --> 00:17:36.620
Good job out there, working on your day off!

00:17:36.620 --> 00:17:40.590
I called you before because I was thinking
about playing an MMO with Morimori-chan.

00:17:40.590 --> 00:17:42.750
I'm downloading it now!

00:17:43.940 --> 00:17:45.870
And of course it's <i>Fruits de Mer</i>!

00:17:47.090 --> 00:17:50.070
I wonder if Morioka-san invited him.

00:17:52.490 --> 00:17:56.500
I wonder if they're getting closer
to one another without me knowing.

00:17:57.480 --> 00:17:58.850
What should I do?

00:17:58.850 --> 00:18:03.350
If the two of them really hit it off,
then won't Lily just get in their way?

00:18:06.580 --> 00:18:07.910
Another picture.

00:18:12.890 --> 00:18:15.900
If I'm not overthinking this...

00:18:17.150 --> 00:18:18.530
I've seen this character.

00:18:21.230 --> 00:18:23.380
I've known her for a long time.

00:18:24.870 --> 00:18:27.780
Man, everyone moves around so fast.

00:18:29.290 --> 00:18:31.290
Sakurai Yuta

00:18:41.050 --> 00:18:42.990
Wait a second, Kanbe-san.

00:18:44.850 --> 00:18:46.860
Harumi-san stopped.

00:18:49.170 --> 00:18:50.930
What happened?

00:18:50.930 --> 00:18:51.860
I wonder.

00:18:53.830 --> 00:18:56.860
Harumi! Hey, what's the problem?

00:18:57.220 --> 00:18:59.350
Had to go potty? Was that it?

00:18:59.350 --> 00:19:00.860
Fall asleep?

00:19:01.220 --> 00:19:03.980
Or did your parents walk in?
Your parents right behind you?

00:19:03.980 --> 00:19:06.870
Get into an argument? Huh? You fighting?

00:19:04.760 --> 00:19:06.590
Looking at that character...

00:19:09.740 --> 00:19:11.880
I wonder if it's that guy.

00:19:18.030 --> 00:19:19.740
Hey, I was wondering...

00:19:21.660 --> 00:19:22.460
Yes?

00:19:29.740 --> 00:19:31.030
I'm back!

00:19:31.030 --> 00:19:35.150
Oh, sorry, I couldn't play and
send an email at the same time.

00:19:35.780 --> 00:19:37.510
Uh, so what is all this?

00:19:38.610 --> 00:19:41.340
There's no real meaning behind it.

00:19:42.190 --> 00:19:45.410
You just kind of want to do it
when you see an AFK character.

00:19:46.050 --> 00:19:47.160
Yeah?

00:19:48.520 --> 00:19:50.910
Sorry for making you two wait!

00:19:51.280 --> 00:19:52.490
It's no problem.

00:19:52.490 --> 00:19:53.670
Are you good to go?

00:19:54.100 --> 00:19:55.670
Yup, all good.

00:20:02.390 --> 00:20:04.400
What am I doing?

00:20:05.460 --> 00:20:08.200
I already decided not to get involved.

00:20:08.620 --> 00:20:11.640
I haven't contacted
Morioka-san since that day.

00:20:12.880 --> 00:20:16.790
Even when Koiwai-san came by to flaunt
the email he got from Morioka-san,

00:20:16.790 --> 00:20:18.790
I ignored him and tried to shrug it off.

00:20:19.400 --> 00:20:22.930
Of course, I still get along with her as Lily.

00:20:23.940 --> 00:20:26.070
I was supposed to be happy with that.

00:20:26.890 --> 00:20:29.150
What I was originally looking for in an MMO

00:20:29.150 --> 00:20:32.210
was a place where I could be someone else.

00:20:33.070 --> 00:20:36.000
I enjoyed getting all sorts
of outfits for a girl character, too.

00:20:36.700 --> 00:20:40.180
And the anonymity I found there was
so blissful, I couldn't get enough.

00:20:41.250 --> 00:20:44.690
As long as I could be
someone else somewhere...

00:20:45.880 --> 00:20:47.990
Or so I thought.

00:20:48.970 --> 00:20:53.170
Honestly, I just want to quit my job so badly.

00:20:53.620 --> 00:20:56.280
But we keep getting new employees.

00:20:56.870 --> 00:20:58.400
In the last MMO I played,

00:20:58.870 --> 00:21:03.400
there were lots of characters with
hair and eyes this color,

00:21:03.980 --> 00:21:04.680
but...

00:21:05.320 --> 00:21:09.410
Can't you talk to a superior
or someone in HR about it?

00:21:11.680 --> 00:21:15.110
It's not that easy to put into words.

00:21:15.910 --> 00:21:17.420
It's hard to sort out.

00:21:18.350 --> 00:21:19.390
Yuki-san.

00:21:20.660 --> 00:21:25.570
I can't help but be reminded of an old
friend that I was very close with.

00:21:27.350 --> 00:21:31.310
But there's no way. I know there's no way my
daydreaming is in line with reality, but...

00:21:33.540 --> 00:21:37.900
Isn't it okay for me to dream just a little?

00:21:40.710 --> 00:21:42.190
I'm back!

00:21:42.490 --> 00:21:44.190
W-Welcome back.

00:21:44.820 --> 00:21:47.700
My friend said he'd start playing, too.

00:21:48.180 --> 00:21:49.700
Look out for him when he comes!

00:21:50.280 --> 00:21:50.830
Huh?

00:21:51.190 --> 00:21:52.650
Sakurai-san?

00:23:24.960 --> 00:23:40.190
Next Episode

00:23:25.230 --> 00:23:28.330
I think what I felt back
then might have been love.

00:23:28.330 --> 00:23:30.340
I was very happy. See you.

00:23:30.530 --> 00:23:32.510
Did I let you down?

00:23:32.510 --> 00:23:34.890
There's no way. Ever.

00:23:35.180 --> 00:23:40.190
Episode 8
One Step Forward

00:23:35.440 --> 00:23:39.390
Episode 8, "One Step Forward."
